printing.color_note = Amaphikseli aguqulelwa ku-sRGB. Isibukeli sakho se-PDF lomphrinta balawula iphrofayili yomphrinta.
printing.sizing_note = Imodi yokulinganisa ifaka isithombe siphelele esitokisini ngasinye segridi singasikwanga. Ubukhulu bangempela busebenzisa i-DPI yedokhumenti; ncipha imigqa kumbe amakholomu egridi nxa singangeni. Phrinta i-PDF ngo-100% ukulinganisa ekhasini kucitshiwe.
