printing.open_print = Gcina uvule i-PDF ukuze uyiphrinte…
printing.invalid = Izilungiselelo zokuphrinta kumbe ubukhulu besithombe akulunganga.
printing.limit = Umsebenzi wokuphrinta udlula umkhawulo: izithombe ezingu-200, amaphikseli ayizigidi ezingu-40 esithombeni ngasinye, amaphikseli angu-32768 kuhlangothi ngalunye lwesithombe, kumbe idatha ye-PDF ecindezelweyo engu-256 MiB.
printing.profile_error = Isithombe lesi silephrofayili yemibala engasebenziyo, engahambelaniyo kumbe engasekelwayo. Imigudu yemibala ye-CMYK/Lab eyakhelwe kudokhumenti idinga iphrofayili esemthethweni efakwe phakathi; i-RGB idinga iphrofayili ye-RGB.
printing.does_not_fit = Isithombe ku-DPI yedokhumenti yaso asingene esitokisini lesi. Sebenzisa imodi yokulinganisa, igridi elemigqa kumbe amakholomu ambalwa kumbe iphepha elikhulu.
printing.caption_limit = Umbhalo ochaza isithombe mude kakhulu kugridi le. Sebenzisa imigqa kumbe amakholomu ambalwa, finyeza umbhalo kumbe ucitshe imibhalo echaza izithombe.
printing.font_error = Akulafonti etholakalayo yombhalo ochaza isithombe. Faka ifonti yombhalo kumbe ucitshe imibhalo echaza izithombe.
printing.no_document = Vula idokhumenti kumbe ukhethe amafoto egalari ungakaprinti.
printing.source_error = Ifotho ekhethiweyo, ifayela elihamba layo elilezinguquko, kumbe umbhalo ochaza isithombe akufundekanga. Akulagcinwanga i-PDF.
printing.save_error = I-PDF kayigcinwanga. Khetha ibizo elitsha lefayela kufolda okuvunyelwa ukulobela kuyo; amafayela akhona awatshintshwa loba nini.
